    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game draws players into a mysterious enclosed space, where they take on the role of a purple ghost battling faceless demons in an environment filled with the unknown. Using the ASDW keys to control the movement of the purple ghost and the space bar to fire blue electric waves at the enemies. Set in a dark and eerie space, the appearance of the purple ghost provides the only splash of color in this silent environment. Players must skillfully use movement and attacks to evade the pursuit of the faceless demons while finding opportunities to counterattack. Each successful attack releases a bright blue electric wave, hitting the target with a crisp sound effect, enhancing the game's interactivity and tension. Players have limited health points, which decrease upon being attacked by the faceless demons, leading to game over when depleted. The game's visuals are simple yet impactful, with well-crafted sound effects, offering players an exciting and challenging experience.</p>",
